              Photoreal mockups before a sample is ordered. SKU adaptation
              across markets without rebuilding every layout. Material and
              finish simulation (matte foil, embossed kraft, soft-touch) before
              a plate is cut.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="wf__viz">
            <div class="wf__bar wf__bar--new">
              <span class="wf__seg wf__seg--solo" style="--span:1;--i:0">
